<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάγχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strangle, throttle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μὲν λάε νεβρὸν ἀπάγχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.230
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλῆν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					795
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃ μάλιστά μ᾽ ἀπάγχει</span>
			<i>chokes</i> me <i>with anger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				686
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηγξάμην,</span> and 
				Pass.
			, <i>hang oneself, to be hanged,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.131
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				465
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				130
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δένδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστε μ᾽ ἀπάγχεσθ᾽</span>”
				<i>am ready to choke,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					988
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάγξασθαι ῥηγνύμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.20.31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
